[[2047,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238343\">5040D22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237934\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238802\">7040A60</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the bolts</p><p>2. Release the passenger compartment temperature sensor and move\nit.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018544.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,16,"<p>1. Turn the control unit in a suitable position and disconnect the\nelectrical connections (1a, 1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Climate control system control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236944\">M70A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Climate control system control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236948\">M70B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018545.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the control unit in the housing and\nconnect the electrical connections.</p><p>Fit the passenger compartment temperature\nsensor in place.</p><p>Tighten the screws.</p><p>Test the operation of the system using\nan  Examiner or other diagnostic equipment.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238802\">7040A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237934\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238343\">5040D22</a></p>"],[2047,96,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238852\">7040L37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238849\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the bolts</p><p>2. Partly extract the control unit.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018546.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,96,16,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections (1a, 1b, 1c, 1d).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Climate control system control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236948\">M70B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Hazard warning lights switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236121\">H20</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Passenger compartment air sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236698\">K89</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>Climate control system control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236944\">M70A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Recover the air conditioning control unit.</p><p>If necessary, \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238270\">5010D30</a></p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018547.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,96,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the control unit is undamaged.</p><p>If necessary, \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238270\">5010D30</a></p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Place the control unit in position and\nsecure it using the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238849\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238852\">7040L37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p>"]]